{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"9d28f423-181c-467a-ae68-6bd98bfc65a6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now README. Include:\n- usage, prerequisites, run command, \"待 CI\"\n- coverage mapping\n- behavior when not delivered\n- alignment points (namespace/assembly/method names; project path)\n- CI note: existing workflow doesn't run this path; ci-guards must add.\n\nAlso, should I create a results log dir? Task says only files under tests/windows/win-diagnostics. A log would go there maybe, but we can't run. No.\n\nOne concern: xUnit package restore requires network in CI; that's normal.\n\nAnother concern: `ProductFactAttribute : FactAttribute` — xUnit v2's FactAttribute is not sealed. Verify: In xunit.core, `[AttributeUsage(AttributeTargets.Method, AllowMultiple = false)] public class FactAttribute : Attribute { public virtual string? DisplayName { get; set; } public virtual string? Skip { get; set; } ... }`. Yes.\n\nWait — xUnit v2 `FactAttribute.Skip` setter: I believe `public string? Skip { get; set; }`. Yes.\n\nBut there's a subtlety: xUnit analyzers might complain xUnit1000? A custom Fact-derived attribute is supported (xunit.skippablefact does it). Analyzers might flag test classes must be public (ours is), test methods public (ours), no constructor args (fine). Maybe xUnit1013? Fine.\n\nHowever, xUnit analyzer xUnit1007? Not.\n\nNow README.","signature":"9d28f423-181c-467a-ae68-6bd98bfc65a6"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":228,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":46080,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec7e012c-bf97-4a00-b1a5-b32ee1d3c38b","uuid":"617b7745-ac41-47ee-b3b8-68d5b562b276","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:04:10.453Z","thinking_duration_ms":2553,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"9d28f423-181c-467a-ae68-6bd98bfc65a6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_FtV6XDFj1Cgm9JYzFHRz5342","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/windows/win-diagnostics/README.md","content":"# win-diagnostics 测试（Windows / xUnit）\n\n用途：覆盖 A3（统一错误展示）、A4（日志脱敏）、A15（邀请码格式），全部断言读 `shared/` 的共享向量。\n\n> 待 CI：本机不装 .NET SDK，未在本机构建或运行；由 GitHub Actions `windows-latest` 执行。\n\n## 前置环境\n\n- Windows + .NET 8 SDK（目标框架 `net8.0-windows`）\n- 仓库保持 `shared/errors.json`、`shared/test-vectors/*.json` 在相对仓库根的位置（测试从输出目录向上查找仓库根）\n- 产品工程由写手交付后，在 `WinDiagnostics.Tests.csproj` 的 `ProductProject`（或 `-p:ProductProject=<路径>`）指向它\n\n## 运行命令\n\n```bash\ndotnet test tests/windows/win-diagnostics -c Release\n```\n\n只跑某一类：\n\n```bash\ndotnet test tests/windows/win-diagnostics -c Release --filter FullyQualifiedName~ErrorPresenterTests\ndotnet test tests/windows/win-diagnostics -c Release --filter FullyQualifiedName~LogRedactorTests\ndotnet test tests/windows/win-diagnostics -c Release --filter FullyQualifiedName~InviteCodeTests\n```\n\n## 覆盖\n\n| 测试 | acceptance | 共享事实来源 | 断言 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `ErrorPresenterTests` | A3 | `shared/errors.json` | 每个错误码显示对应 `zh` 文案；不含 `at `、`Exception`、`System.`、`StackTrace` |\n| `LogRedactorTests` | A4 | `shared/test-vectors/redaction.json` | 全部 case 的 `in` 经入口后精确等于 `out` |\n| `InviteCodeTests` | A15 | `shared/test-vectors/invite-code.json` | `valid` 全为 true、`invalid` 全为 false（含 `null`） |\n\n## 产品未交付时的行为\n\n`ProductSurface.cs` 在测试发现阶段查找产品类型；找不到时该用例以跳过原因 **“待测：模块未交付”** 结束，\n不失败、也不伪装通过。产品工程不存在时 `WinDiagnostics.Tests.csproj` 不引用它，因此测试工程本身仍可编译运行。\n\n## 待写手交付后对齐（只改这些）\n\n1. `WinDiagnostics.Tests.csproj` 的 `ProductProject` 路径。\n2. `ProductSurface.cs` 顶部常量：程序集名、命名空间、`ErrorPresenter` 的入口方法名、`LogRedactor` 的入口方法名。\n   类型名 `ErrorPresenter` / `LogRedactor` / `InviteCode.IsValid` 来自 brief，未改动。\n3. 若入口是实例方法，测试会尝试无参构造；需要依赖注入时在此处适配。\n\n## CI 接线提醒\n\n现有 `.github/workflows/ci.yml` 的 `windows-dotnet` job 只扫描 `windows/` 与 `admin/` 下的工程，\n不会自动发现本目录；该 workflow 归 ci-guards 模块维护，本任务不改。接线时增加一步：\n\n```yaml\n- run: dotnet test tests/windows/win-diagnostics -c Release\n```\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":228,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":46080,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec7e012c-bf97-4a00-b1a5-b32ee1d3c38b","uuid":"a4fe4e77-3ae8-49df-81f4-ebaea53d7833","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:04:14.092Z"}
